{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Fix landed: Gerrit change 2819 merged at 2026-09-08T10:21:05Z after LLM-Review+1, Verified+1, unresolved=0. Service restoration was resetting the Gerrit review-bot HTTP password, updating refs/meta/config webhook token, and restarting only review-bot; rerun on change 2801 returned 202 and produced LLM-Review+1. Code fix: /health keeps HTTP 200 process liveness but reports JSON status=degraded/gerrit_auth=failed when the vote-casting Gerrit credential cannot authenticate; observability parses the body and publishes reviewbot_healthy=0 for degraded status. RED test: tests/unit/test_review_bot_in_flight.py::test_health_endpoint_reports_degraded_when_gerrit_auth_is_broken. Validation: targeted review-bot/observability tests and full make verify passed before PS4; PS4 CI run 34211819826 passed."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788863355925382001,"uuid":"799265b5-feb6-4f78-a8b6-9673c475e540"}